<title>USA: Morgan Stanley surges on NYSE opening.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley surges on NYSE opening.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Morgan Stanley Group Inc surged at their opening on the New York Stock Exchange on news of the company's planned merger with Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Morgan rose shot up 7-5/8 to 65. Dean Witter rose 1-3/8 to 40 at the opening.</p>
